q2pG_selectionAnchorContainer">Discover the authentic heart of Kerala on a leisurely journey through the backwaters of Kumarakom. Cruise along peaceful canals to visit traditional villages, watch skilled toddy tappers climb coconut palms, observe the age-old process of coir making from coconut husks, and see local fishermen using traditional fishing methods. This is one our responsible tourism projects where you directly contribute to the welfare of the local community. They entire activity is operated by the community, you will village residents, learn about their daily routines, and gain a genuine insight into the culture, heritage, and unhurried way of life that has flourished along Kerala's backwaters for generations.<span aria-hidden="true" class="PDq2pG_selectionAnchor"></span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"></div><div class="mt-3 w-full empty:hidden"><div class="text-center"></div></div></div><div data-conversation-screenshot-content="" class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1"><div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)"><br></div><p><br></p>0:{"buildId":"KT_iEaCN6K7u2oDiIQ-tU","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"className":"w-full bg-background","children":[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","section",null,{"className":"relative overflow-hidden flex items-center min-h-[360px] md:min-h-[600px]","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center","style":{"backgroundImage":"url('https://captivationgindia.bvox.in/storage/activities/HCZTXJOFHSk5L1jCZvqfQXeeiuEPhsIeHGlZ3Iuf.jpg')"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"absolute inset-0 bg-black/50"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative w-full py-20 md:py-28 lg:py-32","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 